{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a detective who investigates cases no one else dares to touch. From your investigation hub, choose from a set of\u00a0eerie cases \u2014 each with its own location, puzzles and danger. <br> <br>Use your instincts to hide, crack each puzzle - and survive long enough to escape, even if it means descending into the ghost world itself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics and minimal interface will drag you deeper into each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/05998766bb7d933d89b169d0b01ee34c.poster.avif?t=1757363096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/05998766bb7d933d89b169d0b01ee34c.webm?t=1757363096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/05998766bb7d933d89b169d0b01ee34c.mp4?t=1757363096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough offers a new variation.\u00a0Puzzles, key items, and interactions change with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/4db6eb10f3c4254f26bf9578395a1402.poster.avif?t=1757363096\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/4db6eb10f3c4254f26bf9578395a1402.webm?t=1757363096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/4db6eb10f3c4254f26bf9578395a1402.mp4?t=1757363096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental hiding and escape mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid danger by hiding in closets or escaping through climbable ladders. Ladders can be placed in specific spots, letting you create your own escape paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete the ritual</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cursed objects to perform the final ritual, stop the haunting, and survive the case.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706150?t=1757363096","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/2e88e9ba2d50ca61e1f5f79a7b86258ea1276f9f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757363096","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/6e5654ea87743b40df7d02832652119339906f62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757363096","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/6e5654ea87743b40df7d02832652119339906f62/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757363096","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a detective who investigates cases no one else dares to touch. From your investigation hub, choose from a set of\u00a0eerie cases \u2014 each with its own location, puzzles and danger. <br> <br>Use your instincts to hide, crack each puzzle - and survive long enough to escape, even if it means descending into the ghost world itself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics and minimal interface will drag you deeper into each encounter.</p><p